    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 141 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(My Dream for the Future)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "There are many jobs in the world,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and it is very hard to choose only one."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I am still young,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "but I have read many different kinds of books that have changed"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "my mind many times already about what I want to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "How can I choose among all of the great jobs like being a doctor,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "movie star, and a lawyer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Out of all these fantastic careers,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "my dream right now is to be a teacher."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
        "2 번",
        "3 번",
        "4 번",
        "5 번"
      ]
    },
